{"id":"n63598-1-7","stage":3,"title":"성명 · 姓名","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63598-1-7-1","ko":"성명과 연락처를 남겨 주시겠습니까?","zh":"请您留下姓名和联系方式，可以吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"성명과","meaning":"姓名","explanation":"성명：姓名；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"성명","audio":"/audio/5aa32deffdf1362feb45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63598","senseId":"1","lemma":"성명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성명과","audio":"/audio/b19c095aa235b39c8369.mp3"}},{"text":"연락처를","meaning":"联系方式","explanation":"연락처：联系方式；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"연락처","audio":"/audio/67c1e932f9bc7bd77503.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14014","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락처를","audio":"/audio/e73e8fc6718ddaad0b9c.mp3"}},{"text":"남겨","meaning":"留下，留传","explanation":"남기다：留下，留传；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"남기다","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64371","senseId":"4","lemma":"남기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남겨","audio":"/audio/4e11f95d17e970a4632f.mp3"}},{"text":"주시겠습니까?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주시겠습니까","audio":"/audio/176672ce03a6379a8d36.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5aa32deffdf1362f","term":"성명","zh":"姓名","audio":"/audio/5aa32deffdf1362feb45.mp3","entryId":"63598","definition":"姓和名。","pronunciation":["성ː명"]},{"id":"67c1e932f9bc7bd7","term":"연락처","zh":"联系方式","audio":"/audio/67c1e932f9bc7bd77503.mp3","entryId":"14014","definition":"能够联系到的电话号码或地址。","pronunciation":["열락처"]},{"id":"a129ccc910d85b76","term":"남기다","zh":"留下，留传","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3","entryId":"64371",